flowchart TD
  A[Demand / Shipment / Movement] --> B[Normalize]
  B --> C[Operating + Legal Context]
  C --> D[Capacity / Resource Eligibility]
  D --> E[Feasibility + Readiness]
  E --> F[Economics / Priority / Service]
  F --> G[Candidate Plans]
  G --> H[Deterministic Policy]
  H --> I{Autonomy Grant}
  I -->|Approval required| J[Human Approval]
  I -->|Authorized| K[Idempotency]
  J --> K
  K --> L[Assignment / Tender / Booking]
  L --> M[External Acknowledgement]
  M --> N[Execution Monitor]
  N --> O{Exception?}
  O -->|Yes| P[Exception Graph]
  O -->|No| Q[Completion + Evidence]
  P --> N
  Q --> R[Reconciliation]
